Furthermore, it can be verified that weak inverses for non-zero elements are given by:
    \begin{equation*}
        \begin{bmatrix} a \\ b \end{bmatrix}^\winv = \begin{bmatrix} a/(a^2-b^2) \\ -b/(a^2-b^2)\end{bmatrix}\,\,(\text{for }a\neq b), \quad\quad \begin{bmatrix} a \\ a \end{bmatrix}^\winv =
        \begin{bmatrix} 1/4a \\ 1/4a \end{bmatrix}
    \end{equation*}
